We are here to announce and share our latest update patch with you.

Patch Note:
- Improved room lobby navigation;
- Rebalanced waves for two players (It’s easier now);
- Fixed some localization issues;

Thanks for the whole support and keep struggling! Our kingdom’s future depends on you, guys!

Regards,
Mad Mimic Team

